  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RMGB-TWB IOM: PMM project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">T&#xfc;rkiye is shouldering a major task as it works to address the challenges associated with irregular migration and forced displacement. Turkish migration authorities have adopted a strategic and holistic approach, combining large-scale and targeted projects to maximise cooperation opportunities, focusing on five key areas: legal migration, irregular migration, international protection (including temporary protection), integrated border management, and integration (&#x201c;harmonisation&#x201d;). Support to the PMM will enhance institutional capacity, contribute to the implementation of PMM&#x2019;s strategic plan for 2024-2028 in a safe, orderly, and rights-based manner, and reinforce strategic cooperation between T&#xfc;rkiye and Denmark on migration management. The project adopts a hybrid modality which involves joint implementation between IOM and PMM as well as implementation through an implementing partner agreement with PMM. In addition to this funding to PMM, Denmark, will also provide strategic support PMM in the field of migration management through a number of implementing partners.</narrative>
  </description>
